#*******************************************************************************************************
# Filename              : ModifyRetailCif.scr
# Description           : This script is used to make connection with the third party
# Input                 : 
# Output                : workflow
# Called Script         : 
# Calling Script        :

# Modification History
# Sl. #           Date             Author             Modification           Version
# -----          -----            --------          ----------------        ---------
#  1           19-03-2013         Venkatesh    	      Original Version          1.0
#  2	       02-Aug-2013	Mohan Raghu Arudi     365127 Changes added
#  3           06-Aug-2013      Mohan Raghu Arudi     360586, 364935 Changes added
#  4           16-Oct-2013      Mohan Raghu Arudi     378551 Changes added
